       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Order as written:** ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Usual limits for adults:** The maximum is 3,200 mg/day for prescription use, and single doses are usually capped at 800 mg. This order is twice the daily maximum, and each dose is twice the usual single-dose limit.\n- **Risks:** At this dose the risks of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events go up substantially.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **400\u2013800 mg by mouth, three times daily** (a common regimen)\n- **1600 mg total per day, divided** (for example, 400 mg four times daily)\n\nTell me the dose you want and I'll enter it. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that it's intentional and give the clinical rationale. I'd still suggest pharmacy review before I enter it."
